"Experimental direct color-table method" = "实验性的直接色表方法";
"Hiding takes effect only while Show FBD in the Dock is on (see the OSD section): a menu-bar app with no icon and no Dock icon would have nothing left to click, so the preference is ignored until then." = "仅在开启“在程序坞中显示 FBD”时隐藏才会生效（见 OSD 部分）：既无菜单栏图标又无程序坞图标的菜单栏应用将没有任何可点之处，因此在此之前该偏好会被忽略。";
"Hold ⇧ Shift while launching, or set FBD_SAFE_MODE=1, to skip applying stored configuration for one session — the escape hatch after a bad EDID override." = "启动时按住 ⇧ Shift，或设置 FBD_SAFE_MODE=1，可在本次运行中跳过应用已存储的配置——EDID 覆盖出错后的应急出口。";
